{"id":"wb-7-1502","name":"邢台道德经幢","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"邢台道德经幢","text":"邢台道德经幢位于中国河北省邢台市襄都区清风园内，是一处唐代道德经幢，开元二十七年八月五日邢州刺史李质所建，现为全国重点文物保护单位。经幢通高6.89米，幢身为八角柱形，刻有《道德经》原文及唐玄宗的释文。北宋、清代、中华民国时经幢曾得到重修。文化大革命中，经幢被炸药毁坏，仅余上下两截。1990年，文物部门补刻了炸毁的幢身中段，将幢重新立起，迁移至邢台清风楼后的花园中。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%82%A2%E5%8F%B0%E9%81%93%E5%BE%B7%E7%BB%8F%E5%B9%A2","revisionId":86564855,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86564855","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b15c23292b47ced8046395bc.jpg","title":"邢台道德经幢.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%82%A2%E5%8F%B0%E9%81%93%E5%BE%B7%E7%BB%8F%E5%B9%A2.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3a/%E9%82%A2%E5%8F%B0%E9%81%93%E5%BE%B7%E7%BB%8F%E5%B9%A2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"HaziiDozen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​邢台道德经幢","width":320,"height":569}}